flowchart LR
    Source[Source Range] --> Req[Requirement]
    Req --> Plan[Plan Section]
    Plan --> ADR[Architecture Decision]
    ADR --> Work[Jira Work]
    Work --> Code[Code / Config / Infrastructure]
    Code --> Test[Test]
    Test --> Evidence[Evidence]
    Evidence --> Gate[Completion Gate]
    Gate --> State[Verified State]
    Code -. reverse lookup .-> Req
    Work -. reverse lookup .-> Source
